The adaptation consists of rewriting that course as a stepped, self-contained
HTML artifact with generated figures, interactive laboratories and worked
practice questions, and of writing the prose at the level of a second-year
undergraduate reader. No text, figure or code file from the original is
reproduced verbatim in this repository's build sources.

Changes made are recorded in the git history of this repository.

The presentation engine — the scene renderer, the plotting primitives, the
laboratory kit and the eleven verification gates — is carried forward from the
author's own earlier lecture artifact and is unrelated to the work cited above.

KaTeX (https://katex.org) is vendored into the built artifact under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2013-2020 Khan Academy and other contributors.

