site/ is adapted from the "Moire Interference" shader of Radiant Shaders
(https://radiant-shaders.com, https://github.com/pbakaus/radiant), MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Bakaus. The palette is retuned to this
project mark and the canvas is bound to the page heading rather than to the
window; the licence text is carried in the file itself.
